Textual Modeling Language
=========================

The Textual Modeling language is a small language intented to take notes and build specification
incrementally. It is suited to define both glossaries and at the same time class and object
model.

Structure of the directory
--------------------------

The directory is structure as follow:

    README.md                   This very file
    cheatSheet.tml              A chearsheet that shows the basic syntax of TML
    metamodel/                  A metamodel of TML
      TML.tml                   TML defined using TML
    examples/                   Examples of TML files
      CheatSheet                A simple CheatSheet with the various notations
        CheatSheet.tml          The CheatSheet
      GitHubSpark/              The GitHub Spark tool
        GitHubSpark.tml         TML model for GitHubSpark
      Books                     The Books example
        Books.tml               A simple example with books and people